<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">nutrient-suspension</ansi> (alchemy recipe)

A cloudy suspension, thick and faintly sweet, brewed to keep a hungering
crystal fed without ever waking it fully. A few drops through the
lattice and whatever stirs inside settles again, quiescent, patient, fed
just enough to stay fed. Alchemists who work with it never taste it
themselves -- it is not brewed for a mouth.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       alchemy (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     alchemy_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Healer's Root (x2), Blood-moss (x1), Veilbloom Petal (x1)

